From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 15:36:11 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] VideoPlayer: draw Blu-ray menu pages from one store at GUI
 rate

Blu-ray menu pages share the subtitle overlay store, where a subtitle
open, a subtitle page, a flush or a forced caption ends them. A page
also reaches the renderer only with the next decoded picture. A
libbluray that releases each page when its picture is shown then has
it drawn a picture late, and later still on a still menu.
